{%- import "lib.j2" as lib -%}
{#-
  The persistence rule of registry/qyl/policy.yaml as a runtime table, in the stable package. The
  span views, analyzer QYL0113 and the qyl collector's catalog read this one table, so a test can
  never assert a key that ingest drops. The rule is applied in this order: a not-persisted key
  (and its template children), a not-persisted prefix, then the token rule, which a token-exempt
  key and every vendor key skip.
-#}
