/// </summary>
/// <remarks>
/// A key is not persisted when it is one of <see cref="NotPersistedKeys"/> or a template child of
/// one (<c>http.request.header.&lt;name&gt;</c>), when it starts with one of
/// <see cref="NotPersistedPrefixes"/>, or when it contains one of <see cref="DeniedKeyTokens"/>
/// (ordinal, case-insensitive) and is neither one of <see cref="TokenExemptKeys"/> nor one of
/// <see cref="VendorKeys"/>: a vendor spells its own tags. Keys the collector lifts into columns
/// (<c>session.id</c>, <c>mcp.session.id</c>, <c>gen_ai.conversation.id</c>) are not persisted as
/// attributes.
/// </remarks>
